<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 12, 2003 :: Couple of Epics today!</div><P>After many many many hours in Hate, three elusive drops finally appeared! Grats Zavitar and Lumalie on essence, and Thayet on the staff! Zavitar just lacks one drop for his snakedom... but now onto the epic grats!</P>
<P>Lumalie looking sexy with some bite!<BR><IMG alt="Rezz effects maybe gone too!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/lumalie_epic_02.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Sexy little gnomer showing off her colors!<BR><IMG alt="Yet another pet, and this time not a necro!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/thayet_epic_01.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some belated and incomplete leveling grats...</P>
<P>Grats Erowyn on 65 and Arch Convoker!<BR>Grats Wonderous on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Jenreree on 63!<BR>Grats Aridius on 62!<BR>Grats Thayet on 60 and Arch Mage!<BR>Grats Softeyes on 59!<BR>Grats Juhel on 58!<BR>Grats Tearem on 53!<BR>Grats Valoura on 52!<BR>Grats Wellish on 50!<BR><BR>...will add the others soon!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 10, 2003 :: More Hedge Flagging.. alt night almost!</div><P>Wonderous led us in to get more folks flagged for PoNB, and lots of us dusted off those low level alts to go through. Nice work folks and nice work Tryder on being our only chanter through! And you only went LD once. /laughs</P>
<P>Grats Tryder on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Skull_lined_amice.jpeg">Skull Lined Amice</A>! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 10, 2003 :: Rhags 1 & 2 didn't give up RGC!</div><P>Thanks to folks for running to Ssra to kill Rhag 1 and 2 today! Was planning to head back with more forces to give Arch Lich a try, but realized we didn't have that stupid key. </P>
<P>Grats Kithik on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/pictures/bonegolemvambraces.jpg">Bone Golem Vambraces</A>, Tryder on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/manatwinedstaff.jpg">Mana Twined Staff</A>, Drakshar on saving an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/earringofresistance.jpg">Earring of Resistance </A>from rotting, and Vaea on grabbing an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13332">Orb of Luclinite</A> before it too rotted! Some spells dropped, but not the much desired Remove Greater Curse. </P>
<P>Rhag'Mozdezh only dropped one item for us. Grats Greylok on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/crystal_of_interpretation.jpg">Crystal of Interpretation</A>, and Grajin on saving another Orb from rotting, and some more spells. </P>
<P>No pictures, just imagine big undead snakes. /nods</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 9, 2003 :: Little of both faction tonight, wrong order!</div><P>SG led us to Kael for some faction gaining fun from our dragon kills. Jakr pulled like someone slipped him the catnip, and in no time flat we had demolished arena and every critter standing including any merchants and spectators! SG grouped us up, some more healing power showed up, so we decided to do Vindi. Two folks were on our normal pulling side, and they were nice enough to offer to help or stand aside or whatever, but we decided to give pulling to the cursed side a shot. You know, maybe warping wouldn't happen this time.. </P>
<P>Yeah, ok, so guess that idea is gone. But luckily we were in massive force and did quite well handling Vindi, both his pesky temple guardians, and two or three adds. Was fun to boot! </P>
<P>Grats Feskan on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">Vindi BP</A>, and some folks got some upgrades in the process, I think Morlith got some plate legs and a bracer, and Dorina got some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gladiatorschainleggings.jpg">gladiator legs </A>and Zentox on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gladiatorschainsleeves.jpg">gladiator arms</A>. and he dropped <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8607">that necro spell </A>again.. had almost forgotten about it. Vaea's gonna wonder where she got that...</P>
<P>After Vindi, we saw that Klandicar was still up. Seemed a shame to waste all that faction work and let it sit there, so we took the Balut and Tellie express to Western Wastes! Jakr spotted the previously elusive Harla Dar up and got his new swanky back.. or shoulder, and then we did the 'it's too late to make much of a plan.. just charge and keep SG alive, we got the bards!' Grats Vorne on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">the talisman</A>, Triplet on the Greed roll for some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/reinforced_dragonhide_breastplate.jpg">breastplate</A> that Aridius had gotten last time, Aridius on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/heavydragonhidebreastplate.jpg">minor upgrade </A>to the breastplate he got last time, and Antroe on Greed roll for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/worked_dragonleg_breeches.jpg">worked dragonleg breeches</A>. Some spells dropped, I forgot to look at them. </P>
<P>Nice work running around bouncing factions tonight :)</P>
<P>Grats Aridius on 61!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 53!<BR>Grats Kreegar on 51 and whatever the hell they call beastlords at 51!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 7, 2003 :: Grats Baxis!</div><P>On getting your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics14/celestial_fists.JPG">Celestial Fists</A>... which you can't use the clickie effect of... due to minimum level requirements! Bwahahah! </P>
<P><IMG alt="Undead Monk!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/baxisskel.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Wonderous on 64!<BR>Grats Aridius on 60 and Virtuoso!<BR>Grats Sparkley and Thayet on 59!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 57!<BR>Grats Laeaden on 53!<BR>Grats Vilesong on 52!<BR>Grats Baxis on 48!<BR>Grats Wellish and Curtin&nbsp;on 47!<BR>Grats Morlith on 45!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 7, 2003 :: Vindicator dies again..</div><P>While doing some faction repair work in Kael Arena for the guild, we saw Vindicator up and decided to remedy that! Grats Faileas on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">new breastplate </A>and Kyrt on getting some head! </P>
<P><IMG alt="More damn feet pictures!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vindi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 6, 2003 :: Klandicar down again!</div><P>Nice work coming out and owning this dragon yet again! Grats Vaea on the talisman, and to the greed loot winners on his armor drops and guild bank on his spells!</P>
<P><IMG alt="yah yah..old image from Wonderbutt from first fight.." hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/klandicar.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=12'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a> <a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a> 13 <a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a> <a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a> &nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=14'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
